    "updated_at": "2016-05-11T02:39:15Z",
    "body": "In general there is a movement towards 1:1 constructor to tag name mapping. The thinking is that the current many tag names to one constructor mappings are legacy. I've never heard of someone advocating for a one tag name to many constructors mappinh, but it would similarly fall afoul of this principle, and doesn't seem like a good idea.\n",
